    "answer": {
      "short": "$X=44$ cents per dollar.",
      "worked": "The taxable income is in the fourth bracket.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Tax payable}&=0.258\\times90\\,000\\\\\\text{Tax payable}&=\\$23\\,220\\\\\\text{Excess}&=90\\,000-78\\,800\\\\\\text{Excess}&=\\$11\\,200\\\\23\\,220&=18\\,292+\\frac{X}{100}\\times11\\,200\\\\X&=\\frac{23\\,220-18\\,292}{11\\,200}\\times100\\\\X&=44\\end{align*}$$\nThe rate is 44 cents per dollar.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
